{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这算不算价格欺诈？建议市场监管部门查一查。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和设计可能确实不菲，但15800元是否合理还需等官方公布配置和定价依据。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格真的有点焦虑，孩子喜欢但买不起，希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "15800的儿童车，不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌上路，这波操作我直接笑死。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是在收割家长的智商税？建议家长们理性消费，别被品牌冲昏头脑。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障，但价格确实偏高，希望后续能有更多配置选择。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "儿童电动车市场从几百到几千都有，问界M9儿童车定位高端，定价15800可能只是试探市场反应。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "官方还没定价，销售就报15800，这信息混乱让人怀疑管理有问题，希望官方尽快澄清。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "矛盾激化派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "看到这个价格，我只想说：有钱人的世界我不懂，但吃瓜看戏还是可以的。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，反映的是消费主义对儿童市场的渗透，家长要警惕过度物质化。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这不是自相矛盾吗？看来又是营销套路，先放风试探市场反应。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和设计可能确实有溢价，但15800元远超同类产品。建议等官方公布配置和定价依据再做判断。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福。不过这个价格对普通家庭来说确实有点高。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "15800的儿童车？不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌上路，孩子坐里面更拉风。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，容易养成攀比心理。家长应该引导孩子正确价值观，而不是用金钱堆砌童年。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但15800元确实太贵了。希望官方能给出合理定价，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "问界M9儿童版1:1复刻，但儿童车和真车在安全标准、材质要求上完全不同。建议家长关注产品是否符合儿童玩具安全认证。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "前排围观，看看这波定价最后怎么收场。反正我买不起，就看看热闹。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是消费主义对儿童市场的渗透。我们是否该反思，给孩子的东西是否越贵越好？", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障。虽然价格不菲，但支持国货高端化，希望物有所值。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_081", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这不是自相矛盾吗？坐等打脸。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_082", "text": "从成本看，儿童车用料和工艺可能确实高，但溢价空间也大。建议等官方配置公布后再理性评估。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_083", "text": "想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福，但一万五也太贵了，普通家庭哪舍得。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_084", "text": "问界M9儿童版，尊贵的车主从娃娃抓起，建议再出个儿童版M7，凑齐全家桶。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_085", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，是爱还是炫富？价值观扭曲，带坏社会风气。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_086", "text": "作为家长，我本来想买来当礼物，但15800元实在超预算，希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_087", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，问界这款定位高端，可能用了汽车级材质和智能系统，但值不值还得看配置。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_088", "text": "前排围观，看看这车最后定价多少，会不会真有人买。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_089", "text": "高端儿童车背后是消费升级还是阶层焦虑？我们该反思物质攀比对孩子成长的影响。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_090", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，支持国货，期待正式发布！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_091", "text": "从成本看，儿童车用料和科技配置可能不低，但15800确实溢价严重，建议等官方定价再理性评估。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_092", "text": "孩子看到问界M9儿童车眼睛都亮了，但一万五真不是小数目，普通家庭只能看看了。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_093", "text": "15800的儿童车，开出去就是整条街最靓的仔，但价格也是真·壕无人性。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_094", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，容易养成攀比心理，家长应该理性消费，别被营销带偏。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_095", "text": "作为家长，本来想给孩子买辆好点的儿童车，但这价格直接劝退，希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_096", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，问界M9儿童车如果真卖15800，那配置得有多高？等官方公布配置再下结论。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_097", "text": "前排围观，看看这波定价最后怎么收场，反正我不买，就看个热闹。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_098", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是消费主义对低龄群体的渗透，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_099", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，但价格确实不菲，希望物有所值。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_100", "text": "官方还没公布最终售价，现在讨论15800为时过早，等正式发布再评价也不迟。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
